    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like it's too much work to even find those things. everything is so loud and busy and i'm just... empty. i keep thinking about how much easier it would be if i just wasn't a factor in anything. like if i just opted out of the whole struggle of being a person. it feels like the only way to actually get some peace.",
